# Runtime config (cdc_catalog.runtime_config)

Tunables en **`cdc_catalog.runtime_config`** — keys listadas abajo (hot-reload). Todo lo demás está en `cpp/include/pipeline_defaults.hpp`. `config.json` = **credentials only**. **No** re-seed en cada restart: seeds en `schema_patches` migrations 038/040/054/055/056 solamente.

## Rules

- Read via `RuntimeConfig` with `pipeline_defaults::k*Default` fallback when key absent in DB.
- **Reload** before each run and before each table/batch in long jobs.
- Scope: `(component, conn_id)` → `(component, '')` → `(global, '')`.

## Hardcoded in C++ (`pipeline_defaults.hpp`)

Workers, Kafka topic mode/buckets/partitions, capture producer queue, reconcile tolerances, DDL flags, catalog chunk size, daemon sync interval, etc.

| Constant | Value |
|----------|-------|
| `kApplyWorkerCount` | 12 |
| `kCaptureWorkerCount` | 1 |
| `kFullLoadParallelTables` | 2 |
| `kFullLoadWorkers` | 4 |
| `kKafkaTopicMode` | bucketed |
| `kKafkaTopicBuckets` | 64 |

DDL + seeds: `cpp/include/prod_ops_embedded.hpp` → `DataSync migrate` (`schema_patches` migrations 038/040/054/055/056/057).

## Canonical keys (runtime_config)

| Key | Component | Default |
|-----|-----------|---------|
| `full_load_batch_size` | mariadb_load | 50000 |
| `apply_batch_size` | cdc_kafka_apply | 20000 |
| `apply_worker_count` | cdc_kafka_apply | 12 |
| `logs_retention_days` | global | 7 |
| `applied_events_retention_days` | cdc_kafka_apply | 7 |
| `apply_batch_stats_retention_days` | global | 30 |
| `apply_batch_stats_prune_batch_size` | global | 1000 |
| `apply_batch_stats_prune_max_batches` | global | 500 |
| `applied_events_prune_batch_size` | global | 1000 |
| `applied_events_prune_max_batches` | global | 500 |
| `logs_purge_batch_size` | global | 1000 |
| `logs_purge_max_batches` | global | 500 |

Daemon retention calls each prune function with `p_max_batches=1` in a C++ loop (commit per batch + 50ms pause) so statements stay short under scrapers.

**Retention prune:** `apply_batch_stats` / `cdc_applied_events` / `cdc_catalog.logs` are pruned **once per day at 03:00 America/Costa_Rica** by `cdc_daemon` (`retention_maintenance.cpp`), not at apply worker startup. Session lock `90420055001`; logs purge also uses xact lock `90420057001`.

## Kafka bootstrap / consumer group

- Bootstrap: env `KAFKA_BOOTSTRAP` → `localhost:9092` (no runtime_config)
- Consumer group prefix: `datalake-cdc-apply-{conn_id}-w{N}` (hardcoded)

## C++ pattern

```cpp
#include "pipeline_defaults.hpp"

RuntimeConfig runtime;
runtime.reload(pg);
const auto batch = runtime.get_size_t(
    "full_load_batch_size",
    pipeline_defaults::kFullLoadBatchSizeDefault,
    "mariadb_load",
    conn_id);
const int workers = pipeline_defaults::kFullLoadWorkers;
const int parallel_tables = pipeline_defaults::kFullLoadParallelTables;
```
